        <mxCell id="c95" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;font-family:Helvetica;color:#7A4300;&quot;&gt;Same source port, different PCs? PAT assigns a new global port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;font-family:Helvetica;color:#5B6677;&quot;&gt;PC0 and PC1 both chose :50001 — .11 becomes :50002 so replies stay unique&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=#F5A524;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#7A4300;fillColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44.0" y="730.0" width="810.0" height="78.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
